  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Taylor &amp; Gray is an Irish brand of ethically sourced, sustainably produced furniture and homewares all produced within Europe.</span></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A core essence in founding Taylor &amp; Gray was to provide a go-to website with a handpicked collection of beautiful, timeless pieces for your home that are ethically and sustainably made and sourced.</span></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Our growing concern for sustainability, transparency and traceability within business as well as our passion for art, architecture and interiors formed the basis of Taylor &amp; Gray.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">So, we embarked on a journey to find skilled independent craftsmen and family-run businesses within Europe who shared our values in sustainability, quality, transparency and ethics. We knew &nbsp;we wanted to build relationships directly with the makers to design and select the best products that are handcrafted by them, and bring them to Irish homes. We proudly partner with these makers to provide unique and high-quality products that transform your home with inspired design and natural textures. All of the pieces are handcrafted in Europe- we have partners in Ireland, Portugal, and Spain, and continue to build and develop our partnerships with the best artisans and craftspeople within Europe.</span></p>\r\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Here you will find a handpicked selection of stylish, unique and timeless pieces that you won&rsquo;t find everywhere else- an authentic collection of handcrafted items direct from the makers.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Products range from Portuguese crafted lamps and ceramics, to Irish linen products like Christmas stockings and naturally dyed napkins.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>Our unique selling point is that all items are made within Europe, and sourced in an ethical, sustainable way.&nbsp;</p>",
